OL,3,GNEWSADerailed wagon was dragged through
OL,4,ABarking station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA derailed freight wagon was dragged
OL,7,Ffor almost a mile and through an east
OL,8,FLondon station, according to a
OL,9,Fpreliminary investigation into the
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,FThe Rail Accident Investigation Branch
OL,13,F(RAIB) said one wagon of a GB
OL,14,FRailfreight container train came off
OL,15,Fthe tracks near Barking station at
OL,16,F13:04 BST on 23 October.
