OL,3,GNEWSADerailed wagon was dragged through
OL,4,ABarking station
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe resulting damage to the tracks and
OL,7,Fpoints caused forced part of the c2c
OL,8,Fline to shut for nearly three weeks.
OL,9,FThe freight train had been travelling
OL,10,Ffrom London Gateway in Essex to Hams
OL,11,FHall, Warwickshire.
OL,13,FThe RAIB has said its investigation
OL,14,Fwill look at how the wagon derailed,
OL,15,Fhow the train was loaded and prepared,
OL,16,Fthe design of the wagons and the state
OL,17,Fof the track.
